  "description": "Production-grade MQTT client wrapper for banking and IoT workloads.\n\t\t\tFeatures: auto-reconnect with jittered exponential backoff, circuit breaker,\n\t\t\toffline message buffering, broker-side Last Will & Testament, idle-aware\n\t\t\thealth checks, classified failure reasons + connection info, MQTT 5 sessions, mutual TLS,\n\t\t\tconcurrent dispatch, and pluggable persistence. Drop-in for ASP.NET Core, Worker\n\t\t\tServices, Blazor, WPF, and Console apps.",
